Opus 4.8 and Claude Haiku 5.5). Claude, Mythos, Fable, Opus, Sonnet and Haiku are
trademarks of Anthropic, PBC. This repository is independent work and is not
affiliated with or endorsed by Anthropic.

The test target is a copy of github.com/ulissesflores/ai-energy-claim-provenance
(Apache-2.0, same author) with five deliberately planted vulnerabilities. The
copy itself is not redistributed; harness/plant.py regenerates it from that
public repository.
